{"symbol":"BENCHMARK","yahoo":"BENCHMARK.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"name":"Benchmark Computer Solutions Limited","sector":"Technology","industry":"Software - Infrastructure","website":"https://www.benchmarksolution.com","about":"Benchmark Computer Solutions Limited operates as an information technology (IT) infrastructure solutions and technology consulting company in India. It operates through four segments: IT Infrastructure Solutions; Software and Web based Application Development Services; Application Management Services; and Leasing of Services. The company offers IT equipment sales and rental, IT networking, datacentre, IT security and data backup and recovery solutions. It also provides requirement detailing and analysis; UI prototype and system architecture; application design and development, system testing; provide user acceptance testing platform; and final handover. In addition, the company provides Technical experts Online or offline; Routine check-up of the system; preventive maintenance of the computers, printers, and other accessories; and Attending to any breakdown and emergencies. Benchmark Computer Solutions Limited was founded in 1995 and is based in Mumbai, India.","updated":"2026-09-26T06:12:09+00:00","quote":{"price":38.0,"prevClose":40.0,"marketCap":26.08,"high52":47.88,"low52":18.0,"pe":7.71,"bookValue":44.39,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":11.77,"shares":0.6864,"insiders":81.79,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2023-12-21","2023-12-22","2023-12-26","2023-12-27","2023-12-28","2023-12-29","2024-01-01","2024-01-02","2024-01-03","2024-01-04","2024-01-05","2024-01-08","2024-01-09","2024-01-10","2024-01-11","2024-01-12","2024-01-15","2024-01-16","2024-01-17","2024-01-18","2024-01-19","2024-01-23","2024-01-24","2024-01-25","2024-01-29","2024-01-30","2024-01-31","2024-02-01","2024-02-02","2024-02-05","2024-02-06","2024-02-07","2024-02-08","2024-02-09","2024-02-12","2024-02-13","2024-02-14","2024-02-15","2024-02-16","2024-02-19","2024-02-20","2024-0